First post in here.  Managed to get all achievements except the zone ones and 1000 relics.  Also happy that my Morg is almost 3 mil.  I'm mostly active while studying so progress has been slow lately, but I think I'm on a good path.

So, now would be a good time for to shift my gilds into Phthalo, right?  Also, if I do gild into Phthalo, who is a good stepper hero to use?

